# Backtest corpora are NOT committed.
#
# packages/prediction-engine/src/backtest/README.md states this posture: the
# harness ships with no corpus, and someone obtains one legally (nflverse,
# CC-BY 4.0) and shapes it. data/backtest/nfl_historical_games.json is 1,072,950
# bytes of third-party data regenerated by
# `node scripts/ops/build-backtest-corpus.mjs`.
#
# Scoped .gitignore rather than a line in the root .gitignore: AGENTS.md law 2
# puts .gitignore under "never modify", and this is the narrower, safer
# mechanism. One commit, reversible, affects nothing else in the tree.
data/backtest/
